warning[NK1111]: `{{{{` in a plain string is now two braces.
  --> tests/plain_string_json_braces_are_no_doubled_brace.nika:8:5
   |
 8 |     let escaped = "{{\"a\":{}}}"
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: Only `f"…"` strings fill in `{…}`; a plain string keeps the braces as they are.
   = help: Braces in a plain string don't need escaping any more: write `"{\"a\":{}}"`.
